        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 120142021,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 120142,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 13,
      "SpeakerName": "？？？",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……那个玩偶有名字吗？/n既然是招财猫玩偶，所以叫波奇？",
      "VoiceFileName": "1201420130",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 120142022,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 120142,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 14,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "那不就是狗的名字嘛……这孩子叫白白哦～……。/n很可爱吧，白白……软乎乎毛茸茸的……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "1201420140",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 75,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 2,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 120142023,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 120142,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 15,
      "SpeakerName": "白白？",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……嗨，我是白白。是王雪亲的朋友哦。",
      "VoiceFileName": "1201420150",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 120142024,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 120142,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 16,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "啊，白白……你终于会说话了……？/n为什么会变成这样……？",
      "VoiceFileName": "1201420160",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 79,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 17,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 120142025,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 120142,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 17,
      "SpeakerName": "白白？",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "王雪亲每天都很努力！/n所以神明降下奇迹了哦——！",
      "VoiceFileName": "1201420170",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 120142026,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 120142,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 18,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "这样啊，果然我一直很努力吧……。/n神明还挺有眼光嘛……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "1201420180",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 70,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
