    {
      "Id": 120142028,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 120142,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 20,
      "SpeakerName": "白白？",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……下一个，轮到千寿历。",
      "VoiceFileName": "1201420190",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 120142029,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 120142,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 21,
      "SpeakerName": "白白？",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "绝对会穿帮的吧！？/n而且我连角色塑造都还没……！",
      "VoiceFileName": "1201420200",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 120142030,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 120142,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 22,
      "SpeakerName": "白白？",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "你也在反省自己刚才话说得太重吧？/n即兴发挥，把你的心情放进去就好。",
      "VoiceFileName": "1201420210",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 120142031,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 120142,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 23,
      "SpeakerName": "白白？",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……王雪亲。我——不，我很担心。/n担心你一个人这么拼命，会不会太勉强自己。",
      "VoiceFileName": "1201420220",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 120142032,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 120142,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 24,
      "SpeakerName": "白白？",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "所以我才忍不住说了些重话，/n但其实，我一直都在支持王雪亲。",
      "VoiceFileName": "1201420230",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 120142033,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 120142,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 25,
      "SpeakerName": "白白？",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "所以要是有什么我能做的……/n你、你愿意告诉我的话……我也……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "1201420240",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 120142034,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 120142,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 26,
      "SpeakerName": "白白？",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "变成玩偶之后倒是坦率了。呵呵……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "1201420250",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 120142035,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 120142,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 27,
      "SpeakerName": "白白？",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "刚、刚才那只是演戏而已！/n再说我才不会认同银河座和打工两头兼顾这种——",
      "VoiceFileName": "1201420260",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 120142036,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 120142,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 28,
      "SpeakerName": "白白？",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "嘘！别这么大声，会把她吵醒的！",
      "VoiceFileName": "1201420270",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 120142037,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 120142,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 29,
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "",
      "BackgroundImageFileName": "740",
      "BackgroundImageFileFadeType": 1,
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "FadeValue1": 0.30000001192092896,
      "FadeValue2": 0.10000000149011612,
      "FadeValue3": 0.30000001192092896
    },
    {
      "Id": 120142038,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 120142,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 30,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……呼……呼……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "1201420280",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 120142039,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 120142,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 31,
      "SpeakerName": "白白？",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……好险啊——！要是让王雪发现/n大家都在房间里，她肯定会生气！",
      "VoiceFileName": "1201420290",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 120142040,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 120142,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 32,
      "SpeakerName": "白白？",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "你们不想看看她会有什么反应吗？",
      "VoiceFileName": "1201420300",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 120142041,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 120142,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 33,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……！",
      "VoiceFileName": "1201420310",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 120142042,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 120142,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 34,
      "SpeakerName": "白白？",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "才、才不要！那样我从明天起都不知道/n该用什么表情见她了！",
      "VoiceFileName": "1201420320",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 120142043,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 120142,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 35,
      "SpeakerName": "白白？",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "哈哈。那就别把她叫醒吧。/n好了，王雪也睡熟了，我们回去吧。",
      "VoiceFileName": "1201420330",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 120142044,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 120142,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 36,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（对对，赶紧都给我回去！/n　啊啊真是的，羞得我根本没脸见人……！）",
      "VoiceFileName": "1201420340",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 120142045,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 120142,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 37,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（我居然这么大意……。/n　偏偏还全被她们看到了……）",
      "VoiceFileName": "1201420350",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
